      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the thickness of the laminated porous film</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is not less than 5  ⁇ m, it is possible for the laminated porous film to maintain a strength necessary when it is used as the separator for the lithium-ion battery and obtain a substantially necessary electrical insulating performance. Thus when a high voltage is applied to the battery, short circuit is unlikely to occur. Therefore the battery is excellent in safety.</span>
