      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the SD temperature of the laminated porous film</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">is higher than 140° C., the SD temperatures in this range is insufficient for securing the safety of the battery.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0135">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">thermoplastic resin having the crystal melting peak temperature close to the desired SD temperature</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">As means for adjusting the SD temperature, it is effective to use a means for selecting thermoplastic resin having the crystal melting peak temperature close to the desired SD temperature as the thermoplastic resin to be contained in the layer B and a means for increasing the thickness ratio of the layer B.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0136">
