        <span itemprop="definition">Example 3 Layer A F300SV 100 100 100 D101 MSN-100 0.2 0.2 B225 0.2 0.2 Layer B HZ3300F 80 100 90 P115 Hi-Mic1090 20 10 Production condition Casting roll temperature (° C.) 127 100 125 Vertical stretching 93 25/100 110 temperature (° C.) Vertical stretching ratio (times) 3.6 1.7/2.0 5.0 Horizontal stretching 98 — 110 temperature (° C.) Horizontal stretching 2.6 — 2.2 ratio (times) Relaxation temperature (° C.) 125 — 125 Relaxation rate (%) 18 — 15</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0000">
