        <span itemprop="definition">indicate that the laminated porous films of the examples constructed in the range of the values of the ratio H MD /H TD specified in the present invention had mechanical properties balanced more favorably than the films of the comparison examples constructed out of the values of the range H MD /H TD specified in the present invention.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0278">
